# NearbyQuest / VOYAGE - Environment Variables Example
# No API keys required - this project uses only free public APIs:
#   - Nominatim (OpenStreetMap geocoding) - no key needed
#   - Overpass API (OSM place data)       - no key needed
#   - Leaflet.js (map rendering)          - no key needed
#   - Browser Geolocation API             - no key needed

# If you add a paid service in the future, add it here:
# GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY=your_key_here
# OPENAI_API_KEY=your_key_here
